<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Ciutadella regular&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px; border: 0px; border-spacing: 0px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="text-align: center; border: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div><div style="line-height: 15px; height: 15px; width: 680px;">New Qantas Corporate Airfares Agreement</div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img alt="Qantas" border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2024584735/Module-Header-Brand-Extended-Corporate+Agreement.jpg" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table class="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 26px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">New Qantas Corporate Airfares Agreement</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Dear &lt; AM to insert customer name &gt;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">As per our previous correspondence, Qantas introduced a new domestic fare structure, which became effective on 4 November 2020. Due to the domestic fare changes, we needed to re-calibrate your corporate discounts to align with the revised fares.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">As we had not received a signed variation agreement from you, we are now presenting you with a new Corporate Airfares Agreement. Other than the new discount structure that reflects the new domestic fare structure, the terms are generally consistent with your previous corporate airfares agreement.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">We ask that you sign and return this new agreement as soon as possible.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">To enable your business to still access discounted Qantas fares while you prepare to sign the new agreement, we have already implemented the new Qantas discounted fares.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">To recap, the new fare structure changes provide a package of benefits including:</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><ul style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px;"><li style="line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Reduced fares at the top of the fare structure on some routes</li><li style="line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Increasing the Red eDeal booking classes from 5 to 6, providing more price points within our restrictive fare family</li><li style="line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Reducing the cost of trading up the fare ladder in the Red eDeal fare family</li><li style="line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Corporate discounts in Flex (YB only) and Red eDeal (M only) are being varied to align with these fare changes</li><li style="line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Importantly and based on your steady state booking profile, these changes reflect no additional cost to your business</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Thank you for your ongoing support and please don't hesitate to reach out if you have any further questions.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Yours sincerely,</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Qantas Corporate Sales</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><i>Qantas Airways 